425
00:54:34,390 --> 00:54:36,550
I'm sure she'll come since it's my concert.

426
00:54:36,550 --> 00:54:38,260
That girl...

427
00:54:38,260 --> 00:54:41,170
Must be nice to go on a vacation all on her own.

428
00:54:41,170 --> 00:54:43,340
Where did she go, anyway?

429
00:54:57,170 --> 00:55:00,990
[Ms. Song Eunchae]

430
00:56:21,720 --> 00:56:24,580
Where'd you go?

431
00:56:24,580 --> 00:56:27,130
