442
00:57:49,820 --> 00:57:51,460
You Korean?

443
00:57:51,460 --> 00:57:53,040
You're Korean?

444
00:57:54,850 --> 00:57:58,930
I'm saved!

445
00:57:59,750 --> 00:58:01,610
Saved!

446
00:59:49,880 --> 00:59:51,400
Mom...

447
00:59:58,600 --> 01:00:01,980
Wait! I have a husband! I'm married!

448
01:00:01,980 --> 01:00:03,810
With children!

449
01:00:03,810 --> 01:00:07,510
Just go to sleep! Unless you want to die.

450
01:01:57,830 --> 01:02:01,640
[Here lies Cha Muhyeok]

451
01:02:43,837 --> 01:02:46,593
[News Editing Department]

452
01:02:49,660 --> 01:02:56,750
[The body of a Korean woman was found beside
a grave in the outskirts of Melbourne, Australia...]

453
01:03:00,480 --> 01:03:06,580
He had been terribly lonely even while alive.

454
01:03:06,580 --> 01:03:10,420
So I couldn't allow him to be lonely
afterwards as well.

455
01:03:10,420 --> 01:03:13,250
Just for once in my life. Just this once...

456
01:03:14,630 --> 01:03:17,000
I'll be selfish.

457
01:03:17,000 --> 01:03:19,680
And live for my own sake.

458
01:03:21,260 --> 01:03:24,400
I'll accept the punishment for my sins.

459
01:03:24,400 --> 01:03:26,490
Song Eunchae.
